## 8.  Performance & SEO

| Technique | How |
|-----------|-----|
| **Image optimisation** | `next/image` component |
| **Lazy loading** | `loading="lazy"` or `next/dynamic` |
| **Code splitting** | Dynamic imports (`next/dynamic`) |
| **Caching** | React Query cache, SWR, CDN |
| **SSR/SSG** | `getStaticProps`, `getServerSideProps` |
| **Incremental Static Regeneration** | `revalidate` in `getStaticProps` |
| **SEO meta tags** | `next/head` + `next-seo` |
| **Structured data** | JSON‑LD for products |
| **Accessibility** | ARIA roles, semantic HTML, color contrast |
| **PWA** | `next-pwa` plugin |
| **Analytics** | Google Analytics, Plausible, or Segment |

---

## 9.  Testing

| Layer | Tool | Example |
|-------|------|---------|
| **Unit** | Jest + React Testing Library | Test component rendering |
| **Integration** | Cypress | End‑to‑end checkout flow |
| **Visual** | Storybook + Chromatic | Component snapshots |
| **Lint** | ESLint | Code style enforcement |
| **Type** | TypeScript | Compile‑time safety |

**Sample Jest test**

```tsx
// src/components/ui/Button.test.tsx
import { render, screen } from '@testing-library/react';
import Button from './Button';

test('renders button with label', () => {
  render(<Button>Click me</Button>);
  expect(screen.getByRole('button')).toHaveTextContent('Click me');
});
```

