## 15.  Quick Start Script

```bash
# 1️⃣ Create repo
git init ecommerce-frontend
cd ecommerce-frontend

# 2️⃣ Scaffold Next.js + TypeScript
npx create-next-app@latest . --typescript

# 3️⃣ Install dependencies
npm install tailwindcss postcss autoprefixer zustand @tanstack/react-query axios stripe @auth0/auth0-react

# 4️⃣ Init Tailwind
npx tailwindcss init -p

# 5️⃣ Add scripts to package.json (see above)

# 6️⃣ Add .env.local
echo "NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_..." > .env.local
echo "NEXT_PUBLIC_AUTH0_DOMAIN=your-domain.auth0.com" >> .env.local
echo "NEXT_PUBLIC_AUTH0_CLIENT_ID=..." >> .env.local
echo "STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_..." >> .env.local

# 7️⃣ Run dev
npm run dev
```

That’s it! You now have a fully‑featured e‑commerce frontend skeleton ready to grow.  

Happy coding! 🚀
